        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Civic Education - Presentations on the effect of mass deportation on San Diegans (52 attendees and 73 video views) and the San Diego Unified School District (24 attendees and 11 views). Organized two craft parties and a lunch for children in Tijuana shelters.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
