      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>Voter Empowerment - Analyzed state &amp; local ballot propositions and gave 58 talks explaining them (4,000+ views); posted videos on social media. Coordinated candidate participation in VOTE411 election information website and moderated five candidate forums (365 attendees and 1,508 views). Distributed 4,500 Easy Voter Guides and 7,000 cards about our election info website. Held 35 community tabling events (363 voters registered). Hosted a dinner on the impact of the 2024 election (87 attendees and 139 views). Held monthly Defending Democracy discussions. Developed and presented new talk, Democracy in America, Understanding and Responding to the Challenges (34 attendees; 113 views).</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
        <ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>17149</ProgramServiceExpensesAmt>
      </ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
